   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>WorldCorp builds TVs, and the best-selling model is the E-900. As you can see in the table, each model has a different sales price. Define a data range in this exercise. Choose one that you think is appropriate. Describe the steps you had to follow.</p>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/c111c89b515dd790.jpg\" alt=\"A table lists column headings Model, Inches, Price, Units Sold. Row 1 lists E-900s, 32, $170.00, 8752. Row 2 lists E-900m, 42, $380.00, 10563. Row 3 lists E-900l, 55, $550.00, 9543. Row 4 lists E-900xl, 65, $780.00, 4326.\">",
